    <briefdescription>
<para>Primary graph traits structure that encapsulates all necessary type information for graph representations. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This structure serves as the central point for defining the properties and types associated with a graph, including directionality, vertex and edge properties, as well as representation and identifier types. It is designed to be flexible and extensible, allowing users to customize their graph types by specifying different traits.</para>
